<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">How Insurance Coverage Works</h2>
<p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-espresso-500">
  For in-network plans, we handle all administrative work on your behalf. If you're out-of-network, we'll provide a Superbill so you can file a claim directly with your insurer.
</p>
<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-espresso-500">
  Even with in-network status, individual plans may have restrictions such as visit limits, prior authorization requirements, or referral needs. While we attempt to verify your benefits beforehand, your insurance company makes the final payment determination. We are currently in the process of credentialing with additional insurance providers.
</p>

